{
    "text": " Or maybe you do exist. Not as a specific person, but as a sort of potential, an idea, an expectation of a receiver that I am sending my messages to. It's difficult, of course, for me to get that sense of human-to-human connection with you. I don't know who, when, or what you are. You might exist out there, but I might never get to know anything about you. And at this point, it's time for me to emphasize that there is, in fact, a real person behind this voice. Behind this game. Behind all of this. Now, do you feel any connection to that person? Do you feel like you are with me here, right now? And if this place was, let's say, generated by artificial intelligence, would that make any difference to you? Because it most certainly makes a difference to me as I'm spending my finite life building out this world and making it say something meaningful to someone. Or maybe just to myself.",
